---
import "../styles/global.css";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import SEO from "../components/SEO.astro";

const updated = "19 August 2026";
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logo.png" />
    <SEO
      title="Terms & Conditions | TheArkTech"
      description="The terms and conditions that apply when you engage TheArkTech for software development, websites, apps, or AI automation services."
      url="https://thearktech.in/terms"
      image="https://thearktech.in/banner.png"
      siteName="TheArkTech"
      keywords={[]}
    />
  </head>
  <body class="bg-bg text-ink">
    <Nav />
    <main class="legal-page">
      <div class="container-x legal-content">
        <p class="eyebrow mb-3">Legal</p>
        <h1 class="font-display legal-title">Terms &amp; Conditions</h1>
        <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>

        <section>
          <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
          <p>
            TheArkTech ("we", "us") is a software development agency based in Coimbatore,
            Tamil Nadu, India. We build websites, web and mobile applications, and
            AI-powered automation for businesses. These terms apply to your use of
            thearktech.in and to any services you engage us for.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>2. Quotes and engagement</h2>
          <p>
            Project scope, timeline, and pricing are agreed in writing before work begins.
            Quotes we provide are fixed for the agreed scope; changes to scope may change
            the price and timeline, and will always be agreed with you first before we
            proceed.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>3. Payment</h2>
          <p>
            Unless agreed otherwise, projects are invoiced with an advance payment before
            work starts and the balance on delivery. Ongoing services (maintenance,
            hosting management, automation) are billed at the agreed recurring rate.
            Deliverables remain our property until payment is received in full.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>4. Intellectual property</h2>
          <p>
            On full payment, you own the final deliverables we build for you — the design,
            code, and content created specifically for your project. We retain the right
            to use general-purpose tools, libraries, and know-how we bring to the project,
            and to showcase completed work in our portfolio unless you ask us not to.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>5. Your responsibilities</h2>
          <p>
            You are responsible for the accuracy and legality of content, branding, and
            data you provide to us, and for confirming you have the rights to use them.
            Timely feedback and approvals help us keep to the agreed schedule.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>6. Warranties and liability</h2>
          <p>
            We build and test our work with professional care, and we fix defects in the
            agreed scope reported within the support window agreed for your project. The
            website and our services are otherwise provided "as is". To the maximum extent
            permitted by law, our total liability for any claim is limited to the amount
            you paid us for the specific work giving rise to the claim, and we are not
            liable for indirect or consequential losses such as lost profits or data.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>7. Third-party services</h2>
          <p>
            Projects often depend on third-party services (hosting providers, domain
            registrars, payment gateways, APIs, WhatsApp). Those services have their own
            terms, and we are not responsible for their availability or changes to them.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by the laws of India, and any disputes are subject to
            the jurisdiction of the courts of Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2>9. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these terms? Email
            <a href="mailto:contact@thearktech.in">contact@thearktech.in</a> or message us
            on <a href="https://wa.me/919489722142" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </main>
    <SiteFooter />
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 8rem 0 5rem;
    min-height: 60svh;
  }
  .legal-content {
    max-width: 46rem;
  }
  .legal-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    line-height: 1.05;
  }
  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .legal-content section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .legal-content h2 {
    font-family: "Clash Display", sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .legal-content p {
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--brand-bright);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
